  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="cc1b4d17-8bfe-5b9e-b1fc-9beba8006557" activityNameId="a4a037c2-7aa1-5db7-9cb2-b3156f33823e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Grass seed organic, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Grass seed organic, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of grass seed  (rye grass) from intensive organic production with water content of 10% The  dry matter content of dried grains is 0.9 kg/kg. The grains contain 1.55 kg CO2 and 17.87 MJ per kg DM seed.;
UUID: 91ad53a6-0cbd-3efb-9631-11fc16e1e119
The inventories include the production of organic grass seed on a temporary meadow and its further processing and storage. Included steps are soil cultivation, fertilisation (cattle slurry and manure), harvest,  transport, processing, drying and storage.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive organic production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_91ad53a6-0cbd-3efb-9631-11fc16e1e119.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
